      "F12": "A hyperechoic mass in the hypogastric region surrounded by intestinal loops is suggestive of a midline anomaly, such as Meckel's diverticulum or urachal cyst.",
      "F13": "A hyperdense midline mass above the bladder is consistent with a urachal cyst or other midline anomalies."
